r in rows:\n    for c in r: counts[c] = counts.get(c, 0) + 1\nprint('\\n'.join(rows))\nprint('legend counts:', dict(sorted(counts.items())))\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/wireplan-scripts/map.py","description":"Generate and validate the neighborhood ASCII map"}}}
