{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CMLbXnysqWChukyUbvemxv","type":"tool_result","content":"1645\t| | not CI | \"Corey Lyle: serving five years for possession with intent.\" |\n1646\t| Rook *(shown if `wallOff` or `rookFree`; otherwise the Sunday card)* | `wallOff` | \"Ricky Batts: eight years on a gun charge from a taillight stop.\" |\n1647\t| | `rookFree` | \"Ricky Batts: shot in December over a parking space. His son got the shoes.\" |\n1648\t| Sunday *(shown when Rook's card isn't)* | stay | \"Royal Odom: still drives the hearse. Still doesn't work Sundays.\" |\n1649\t| | call | \"Royal Odom: robbed a Hurricane stash in November. Nobody called it in.\" |\n1650\t| | go in | \"Royal Odom: sent Detective Whitlock a card at Christmas. No return address.\" |\n1651\t| Pruitt (always) | — | \"Maj. Leland Pruitt: promoted to Colonel, Administrative Bureau.\" |\n1652\t| Dana | A / B / Shut Down | \"Dana Whitlock: back in Western narcotics. Drives past the corner every day.\" / \"…assigned to the State's Attorney's money task force.\" / \"…back in uniform on the midnight shift.\" Add \"Her mother moved to the county in November.\" if `momSafe` |\n1653\t| Lou | not Shut Down / Shut Down | \"Lou Szabo: back in Homicide. Fourteen open cases on the board.\" / \"Lou Szabo: retired. Took up fishing. Hates fishing.\" |\n1654\t| Navarre | A / else | \"Gil Navarre: promoted to captain.\" / \"Gil Navarre: passed over for captain.\" |\n1655\t| Hal (always) | — | \"Hal Pettiford: kept the wire room. Nobody told him to leave.\" |\n1656\t| Teaser (always last) | — | \"Glenn Harstad: guest of honor at State Senator Marian Ocheltree's harbor fundraiser.\" → **TO BE CONTINUED** |\n1657\t\n1658\t## Appendix H: Music scores (engine `audio.music` format; all checked: every bar is 16 steps, notes are valid, the JS parses)\n1659\t```js\n1660\tconst H = '- - - - - - - - - - - - - - -';        // 15 holds: the note before it lasts the whole bar\n1661\tconst