{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCLhDkbvFT9asU99iSvrfm","type":"tool_result","content":"1724\t| ostrowski | 108 | .20 | 11 | square | .88 | .10 | — |\n1725\t| vance | 220 | .20 | 14 | triangle | 1.08 | .06 | — |\n1726\t| halloway | 98 | .14 | 9 | sawtooth | .88 | .20 | — |\n1727\t| easy | 108 | .10 | 9 | sine | .90 | .18 | soft (gain .8) |\n1728\t| lonnie | 125 | .18 | 11 | sawtooth | .92 | .20 | — |\n1729\t| tee | 158 | .20 | 13.5 | triangle | 1.00 | .10 | — |\n1730\t| rook | 102 | .30 | 12 | sawtooth | .87 | .30 | — |\n1731\t| corey | 188 | .35 | 15.5 | square | 1.05 | .12 | stammer .3 |\n1732\t| pigeon | 330 | .30 | 15 | square | 1.20 | .05 | — |\n1733\t| moe | 350 | .30 | 16 | square | 1.22 | .05 | — |\n1734\t| dink / tavon | 200 / 175 | .25 | 14 | triangle | 1.05 / 1.0 | .08 | — |\n1735\t| pockets | 172 | .40 | 16 | sawtooth | 1.00 | .35 | — |\n1736\t| odessa | 238 | .18 | 10 | sine | 1.08 | .15 | vibrato .03 |\n1737\t| sunday | 128 | .12 | 10 | triangle | .93 | .15 | — |\n1738\t| dale | 132 | .15 | 11 | square | .95 | .10 | — |\n1739\t| civilians | seeded: men 100-170, women 190-280, kids 300-360 | .15-.35 | 10-15 | any | .9-1.2 | .05-.3 | — |\n1740\t\n1741\t**Voiceprint glyph** (voice ID, §6.6): 16 bars. Bar *i* height = `round(8 × (0.5 + 0.5 × sin(base/37 × (i+1) + formant × 3 + wave index)))`, colored by `range`. Deterministic, distinct per profile, shown in the LIVE panel during a call and in the ID strip.\n1742\t\n1743\t## Appendix J: Data schemas and the feature matrix\n1744\t**J.1 STATE** (the only thing saved):\n1745\t```js\n1746\t{ v: 1, ep: 1, beat: 'e1.cold', played: 0, tips: {},\n1747\t  meters: { brass: 60, heat: 10, legal: 0, case: 0, fund: 200 },\n1748\t  flags: { odessaRespect: false, pocketsMet: false, coreyCI: false, wireUp: false, reupSpot: null, dilemma: null, sweep: false,\n1749\t           wallOff: false, rookFree: true, lossOn: null, pigeonTrust: 0, promise: false, canary: false, coreyExposed: false,\n1750\t           coreyRescued: false, momSafe: false, path: null, i5: null, danaKnown: false, teeShort: false, rookDrew: false },\n1751\t  photos: [{ id, subject, t, place, stars, tags, turn, light, ep }],\n1752\t  evidence: [{ id, kind: 'photo'|'obs'|'stmt'|'page'|'int'|'seizure'|'plate'|'serials', ref, pts, text }],\n1753\t  facts: ['face:tee', 'obs:corey:stash', 'num:P1:tee', …],\n1754\t  numbers: { P1: { n: '555-0187', known: true, tapped: false, dead: false, user: 'tee' }, … },\n1755\t  board: { pins: { lieutenant: 'tee', … }, links: [['tee','P1'], …] },\n1756\t  wire: { lines: { P1: 'up' }, logs: [{ call, line, t }], ids: { UM1: 'tee' }, voiceprints: ['tee','rook', …] },\n1757\t  cipher: { dir: 'cw', solved: { cw: false, ccw: false } },\n1758\t  crew: { discipline: 1, goodwill: 0, count: 0, stash: 'v1412', phones: 'payphones', knows: ['dana'] },\n1759\t  stats: { photos: 0, made: 0, minimized: 0, violations: 0, chases: 0, tails: 0, retries: 0 } }\n1760\t```\n1761\t**J.2 Mission** (`def('missions', id, {...})`):\n1762\t```js\n1763\t{ id: 'photos1', time: 'day', clock: [15, 0, 17, 30], weather: null, music: 'field', player: 'dana', start: [24, 29], partner: null,\n1764\t  cast: [{ person: 'tee', role: 'lieutenant', at: 'post' }, { person: 'pigeon', role: 'lookout', at: [35, 36, 40] }, …],\n1765\t  civilians: 25, corner: { open: true, rate: .12 }, interactables: ['pocketsAlley', 'busBench', 'marketSoda', 'chevy'],\n1766\t  objectives: [{ id: 'faces', text: 'Photograph the crew', need: 'facesAll(tee,rook,corey,pigeon)' }, { id: 'reads', need: 'reads>=2' },\n1767\t               { id: 'pockets', need: 'flag:pocketsMet' }, { id: 'act', optional: true, need: 'photoTag:act' }],\n1768\t  events: [{ at: '16:10', every: '0:12', do: 'teeCallsP1' }], done: 'all(faces,reads,pockets) && at(chevy)', fail: null, checkpoints: [] }\n1769\t```\n1770\t**J.3 Beat** (`EPISODES[n].beats[]`): `{ id: 'e2.box', kind: 'card'|'annex'|'field'|'wire'|'box'|'chambers'|'paper'|'cipher'|'corner'|'ops'|'scene'|'montage', ref, stations?, story?, if?, next? }`.\n1771\t\n1772\t**J.4 Person** (`def('people', id, {...})`): `{ name, alias, role, rig: { build, size, outfit, hair, hat, hood, sleeves, hunch, colors }, voice, shoes: 'text for Pockets', portrait: { zoom, turn } }`.\n1773\t\n1774\t**J.5 Call** (`def('calls', id, {...})`): `{ session: 's1', t: '16:40', line: 'P1', from: 'tee', to: 'tavon', type: 'N'|'P'|'T', turnAt?, lines: [['tee','You see the game?'], …], keys: [3], unlock: ['fact:reupRiddle'], if?: 'flag:danaKnown' }`.\n1775\tRoutes: `{ id, waypoints: [[x,y], …], acts: { 3: ['window', 3] }, checkpoints: [4, 9] }`. Escape graphs: `{ nodes: { A: [30,33], … }, edges: [['A','B','run'], …], exits: ['X1','X2'] }`. Interactables: `{ id, at, r, verb, when, act }`. Montage cards: `{ who, if, text }`.\n1776\t\n1777\t**J.6 Feature matrix** (every feature, where it's taught → where it comes back):\n1778\t| Feature | Taught | Comes back |\n1779\t|---|---|---|\n1780\t| Move/run/crouch/blend/cover, heat and made | Ep1 cold open + 1.4 | every field beat, versus |\n1781\t| Watch, read roles, photos, polaroids, shoes | 1.4 | 2.3, 3.4 (long lens), 5.3B, versus |\n1782\t| Eavesdrop, barks, informant | 1.4 | 3.3 (Pockets fallback) |\n1783\t| Annex hub, car scenes, notebook, Board | 1.3, 1.5 | every episode |\n1784\t| Tee: order wheel, code card, payphone keypad, the count, counter-surveillance | I1 | I2-I4, versus (Corner) |\n1785\t| Payphone numbers | 2.3 | affidavit, wire |\n1786\t| Chase: sprint, vault, tackle, cuff, ditch, search | 2.3 | 5.3A rescue sprint, attract |\n1787\t| Box (4 approaches, evidence, combo, flip, lawyer) | 2.4 | 3.6 (Rook), 4.5 (kitchen variant) |\n1788\t| Cipher (turn the pad), known-plaintext flip | 2.5 | 3.3/3.6 live pages |\n1789\t| Affidavit + necessity honesty + judge | 2.6-2.7 | 4.6 (amendment) |\n1790\t| Wire: minimize, spot-check, log, voice ID, pages, fast-forward, legal | 3.2-3.3 | 3.6, 4.7 |\n1791\t| Van stakeout, van heat, plate photo | 3.4 | — |\n1792\t| Moral choices (dilemma, threat to life, mother, canary, loss) | 3.4 | 3.6, 4.7, I3, I4 |\n1793\t| Ops choices and Brass/Heat/Legal/Case meters | 1.3 | every episode, endings |\n1794\t| Tail with partner hand-off | 4.3 | 5.3B (moving cone) |\n1795\t| Stealth search (trash) | 4.4 | — |\n1796\t| Raid (plan, breach, flush, search) | 5.3A | — |\n1797\t| Endings, montage, credits, episode select | 5.6 | — |\n1798\t| Versus (hidden identity, call-outs, burn, tap, jump-out, bots, split screen, hub) | versus | attract |\n1799\t| Attract reel, touch-only notice, settings (glyphs, inversion) | title | everywhere |\n1800\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XnCMPJrdKsvgzZ1BF12Jst","agent_id":"af67e84b720105c7c","session_id":"e2aa65a8-ee1a-45c4-b8e6-f96cf188e23d","uuid":"ae9c77f4-5ca5-4ac8-8021-25f05a549395","timestamp":"2026-11-03T18:58:48.305Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YCLhDkbvFT9asU99iSvrfm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review game plan for gaps"}
