{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KUbvKyVkPGvu2xaTy19mo9","type":"tool_result","content":"149:3. viewport meta (`width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover`), hub tags (§9.6), `<meta name=\"hub:type\" content=\"Game\">`, `<meta name=\"hub:players\" content=\"1-4\">`, `<title>WIRETAP</title>`, `<style>` with `ui.css`\n200:- **In an AI Hub session** (`AIHub.active`), 99-start skips the title: `menu.quit = false`, `autoPause: false`, and goes straight into the versus round (§9.6).\n431:- **Speeds:** runner sprints 118 for 9 s, then jogs 95 (no regen). Dana sprints 125 with stamina (§5.0).\n436:- **Win:** cuffed. **Lose:** the runner reaches the map-edge exit node; retry from the chase start.\n606:- Customer arrivals: Poisson λ = 0.12/s base (story), 0.25/s (versus); × night 1.2; × package freshness (1.2 fresh → 0.8 stale); × 0 while shut down.\n801:  - **Corner win:** at time-up, Count ≥ **$3,000** and Evidence < 100.\n915:| `versus` (104 bpm, C minor) | versus rounds | `pressure` at Evidence ≥ 50; `clock` in the last 60 s; `cash` at Count ≥ $2,000 |\n1184:| chase | Bot pursuer with good routing catches the runner within 60 s; the ditch happens; the kid takes it after 45 s if it's not searched |\n1363:At 15 s Lou's car blocks the edge into `X1` or `X2`, whichever is closer to Corey's heading.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2aa65a8-ee1a-45c4-b8e6-f96cf188e23d","uuid":"217bacf3-53aa-41b7-ac81-fa96712c80ab","timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:18:22.419Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"149:3. viewport meta (`width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover`), hub tags (§9.6), `<meta name=\"hub:type\" content=\"Game\">`, `<meta name=\"hub:players\" content=\"1-4\">`, `<title>WIRETAP</title>`, `<style>` with `ui.css`\n200:- **In an AI Hub session** (`AIHub.active`), 99-start skips the title: `menu.quit = false`, `autoPause: false`, and goes straight into the versus round (§9.6).\n431:- **Speeds: